WEBVTT

00:02.000 --> 00:03.000
These past few days

00:03.120 --> 00:04.760
This old minister met someone

00:04.960 --> 00:05.360
Perhaps

00:05.440 --> 00:07.320
Can solve the current difficulty

00:08.400 --> 00:09.800
Who?

00:10.640 --> 00:11.720
The Chen family's eldest daughter

00:11.800 --> 00:13.200
Chen Wan'er

00:13.400 --> 00:14.440
A few days ago

00:14.520 --> 00:16.800
Miss Chen sent someone to find me

00:16.880 --> 00:18.320
And said only one thing

00:18.400 --> 00:19.600
Regarding this marriage

00:19.680 --> 00:22.347
She and Your Highness share the same position

00:22.560 --> 00:23.720
She doesn't want to marry

00:23.800 --> 00:25.120
The reason for this

00:25.200 --> 00:27.120
This old minister does not know

00:27.760 --> 00:28.680
This old minister thinks

00:28.760 --> 00:30.760
Your Highness could meet with her

00:31.120 --> 00:32.787
To find out the truth

00:59.640 --> 01:01.040
Prince of Jin

01:01.120 --> 01:02.680
I almost didn't recognize you

01:02.760 --> 01:04.040
Miss Chen

01:04.120 --> 01:06.160
Has a man's ambition in her heart

01:06.240 --> 01:07.907
But is a woman's body

